      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>As no short-circuit withstand time (SCWT) is given in ds , there is no short-circuit withstand time (SCWT) for this SiC.</p><p>For protection against overcurrent you have to use fast current limiting circuit, respecting the SOA .</p></div>"
